<!-- Bdubs' vehicle trader (id 75) is added by ZZZ_BDUBS_UL, which loads after this add-on, so it can't be reached from here.
     The DLL gives it (and any other real trader a later mod adds) 1 roll of each group once every mod has patched traders.xml. -->
</configs>
